config SSV6256
	tristate "iComm SSV6256 SDIO wireless support"
	depends on MAC80211 && MMC
	help
	  This driver supports the iComm SSV6256 802.11b/g/n SDIO chip
	  (the "Turismo" family, which identifies itself as SSV6006C),
	  found in TV boxes, in station mode.

	  It needs the firmware file ssv/ssv6x5x-sw.bin.

	  If you choose to build a module, it'll be called ssv6256.
